{"3990840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Astro Flame: Starfighter", "steam_appid": 3990840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the last pilot left to take to the skies while the enemy has already claimed space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your base is in flames. Your fleet is almost destroyed. Only you and your starfighter remain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astro Flame: Starfighter is not just another arcade scrolling shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s a test of your reflexes, endurance, and survival skills in a chaos where there’s no room for mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990840/extras/be1265e6fc859a7c53b07dc5c35961a7.poster.avif?t=1762698041\" width=1170 height=560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990840/extras/be1265e6fc859a7c53b07dc5c35961a7.webm?t=1762698041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990840/extras/be1265e6fc859a7c53b07dc5c35961a7.mp4?t=1762698041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll start with simple skirmishes, but soon you’ll be thrown into a real hail of bullets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision counts: boost your shields or upgrade your guns? Use your super bomb now or save it for the boss fight?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, every battle is a challenge, every upgrade is a chance to survive a little longer, and every mission is a step closer to a new encounter, where the enemy is stronger and deadlier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What awaits the pilot:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adrenaline and speed: nonstop gameplay where even a moment of distraction can mean death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ship upgrades: from basic cannons to energy bombs, electro guns, and support drones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic bosses: massive enemies that unleash a storm of fire and test your nerves to the limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 diverse missions: from station skirmishes to clashes with enormous fleets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spectacular 3D graphics and special effects: turning every battle into a cosmic show.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade spirit: simple controls, but a real challenge for fans of classic shooters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astro Flame: Starfighter is a fast-paced space shoot ‘em up in the finest traditions of the bullet hell genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot your starfighter, upgrade your weapons, and survive the onslaught of enemy fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is for those who miss classic arcades and want to test themselves in a modern scrolling shooter. There’s nothing extra—just you, your ship, and an endless cosmic war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the last pilot left to take to the skies while the enemy has already claimed space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your base is in flames. Your fleet is almost destroyed. Only you and your starfighter remain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astro Flame: Starfighter is not just another arcade scrolling shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s a test of your reflexes, endurance, and survival skills in a chaos where there’s no room for mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990840/extras/be1265e6fc859a7c53b07dc5c35961a7.poster.avif?t=1762698041\" width=1170 height=560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990840/extras/be1265e6fc859a7c53b07dc5c35961a7.webm?t=1762698041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990840/extras/be1265e6fc859a7c53b07dc5c35961a7.mp4?t=1762698041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll start with simple skirmishes, but soon you’ll be thrown into a real hail of bullets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision counts: boost your shields or upgrade your guns? Use your super bomb now or save it for the boss fight?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, every battle is a challenge, every upgrade is a chance to survive a little longer, and every mission is a step closer to a new encounter, where the enemy is stronger and deadlier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What awaits the pilot:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adrenaline and speed: nonstop gameplay where even a moment of distraction can mean death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ship upgrades: from basic cannons to energy bombs, electro guns, and support drones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic bosses: massive enemies that unleash a storm of fire and test your nerves to the limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 diverse missions: from station skirmishes to clashes with enormous fleets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spectacular 3D graphics and special effects: turning every battle into a cosmic show.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade spirit: simple controls, but a real challenge for fans of classic shooters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astro Flame: Starfighter is a fast-paced space shoot ‘em up in the finest traditions of the bullet hell genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot your starfighter, upgrade your weapons, and survive the onslaught of enemy fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is for those who miss classic arcades and want to test themselves in a modern scrolling shooter. There’s nothing extra—just you, your ship, and an endless cosmic war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "You are the last pilot standing against an enemy fleet. Upgrade your starfighter, face epic bosses, and survive the chaos of space battles. Astro Flame: Starfighter is a fast-paced arcade shoot ‘em up in the spirit of the classics.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990840/a4783c052eec1c4acd14f908892655604ebc5ae8/header.jpg?t=1762698041", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990840/2e0431760621d161b8a023d93b06ef66a6c0d1ba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762698041", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990840/2e0431760621d161b8a023d93b06ef66a6c0d1ba/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762698041", "website": "http://satur.biz/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.8 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1 GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "rec